    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Dream Echo Reservoir.</strong> You have learned to bottle fragments of unrealized possibility. At the end of each a Soma Break, you gain <strong>1 Echo Die (d6)</strong>, and you may store up to <strong>2</strong>.</p><p>You may spend an Echo Die in the following ways:</p><ul><li><strong>Self-Resonance:</strong> When you fail an attribute check, attack roll, or defense check, add +1d6 after seeing the roll.</li><li><strong>Shared Echo:</strong> When an ally within 6 squares fails an attribute check or defense check, you may add +1d6 to their roll.</li><li><strong>World-Tuning:</strong> When the environment makes a check against you (Travel hazard, Slippage shift, Qliphothic anomaly, etc.), reduce the DC by <strong>1d6</strong>.</li></ul><p>These effects represent you nudging possible outcomes back toward resonance.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
